{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7c1e5a4-3f2d-4a18-9c6b-2d0f5e8a1c34",
    "name": "IZSuite - Public API",
    "description": "Read-only list endpoints for apps, app categories and plans.\n\n**Base URL**\nIIS holds port 80 on this machine, so Laragon nginx serves the vhost on port **8080**. The `:8080` is required - without it the request hits IIS and comes back as a 404 HTML page.\n\n- Laragon vhost: `http://izsuite-admin.test:8080/api/v1` (default)\n- artisan serve: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1`\n\n**Auth**\nBoth endpoints are public - no token required.\n\n**Response shape**\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [ ... ],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"current_page\": 1,\n    \"last_page\": 1,\n    \"per_page\": 15,\n    \"total\": 3,\n    \"from\": 1,\n    \"to\": 3,\n    \"has_prev_page\": false,\n    \"has_next_page\": false\n  }\n}\n```\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "App Categories",
      "description": "Public list of active app categories.\n\nOnly rows with is_active = true are returned, sorted by name.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List App Categories",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"body has data + pagination\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('data').that.is.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('pagination');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.pagination).to.have.property('current_page');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.pagination).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/app-categories",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "app-categories"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Partial match on category name.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "15",
                  "description": "Rows per page. Allowed: 10, 15, 25, 50, 100 (default 15). Anything else returns 422.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Page number (default 1).",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns every active app category, 15 per page."
          },
          "response": []
        },
